cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NomosFlow
message: >-
  If you use this software or the experimental results, please cite
  the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sinha
    given-names: Ranjan
    affiliation: IBM Research
repository-code: https://github.com/IBM/nomosflow-framework
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  NomosFlow is an event-driven compliance sidecar for AI agents that enforces
  data-governance policies across a five-tier validation pipeline (APL, CMF,
  OPA, rate-limit, LLM). This repository contains the sidecar source and the
  full experiment suite used to produce the results in the accompanying paper.
keywords:
  - compliance
  - AI governance
  - data governance
  - open policy agent
  - sidecar
